    "body": "I just tested with `ILCE-7SM3` also, I suppose it works with _all_ CXD90057 devices (aka BIONZ XR)\r\n\r\nCurrently tested working:\r\n\r\n- ILCE-7M4\r\n- ILCE-7SM3\r\n- ILCE-1\r\n- ILCE-1M2\r\n- ILCE-6700\r\n- ILCE-7CM2\r\n- ILCE-7RM5\r\n- ILME-FX2\r\n- ILME-FX3\r\n- ILME-FX6\r\n- ILX-LR1",
