    "updated_at": "2026-09-16T23:52:54Z",
    "body": "I figured out why `ILME-FX6` v6.01 wasn't decrypting properly - there are 13 possible keys, selected by an index in the key derivation code:\r\n\r\n```\r\nk0  376a61d907035cf18300f2add6503e649fccf0c0191dcc38c3b05895150a7fb6\r\nk1  09bd439a20f8af7e747c829ce9de67ffcb12959e9a5b4ea63c373ba3cbea53e2\r\nk2  2bf6be1a63be263f45ec27259166ec2cd453cbb4d610dcd0464bbf0a01ffd523\r\nk3  d9ba47953df3edc80ff71723ef5f613cfb822d27917cb46d16fbdb560fdb3e74\r\nk4  d2652cd6ccb727ab507172b06e91846fca111247515d82eac00b5041a94fc5d1\r\nk5  b5753286f3d4b9099066060c54ba6477f6ab0fe89ee88fdc1113022c934a1cd4\r\nk6  ce8e3a99ac9776a204dfeb4ff1c300f927b0b979ec64e11ed38b4e6fa4218534\r\nk7  2fc94d4b6b1b2419c2001ee08d7c3df5de38b25a551c67ba949efe31abb4525e\r\nk8  434589432d319010f1132727353286ce4d7ede8b9c4f7217a0e0226e0f0edc69\r\nk9  db05c7736b3e9d27c689532d5e29587f5c2d2061975d5ccb7229e3c392817f43\r\nk10 3119c091367d7acdb5987682a776c73f6030164fc9d7e57ba756d9b6e14973e3\r\nk11 97bedcd787975773b249a24dba09a6619f0d4d05a074fa820fd1cf5c7d07d23e\r\nk12 56a5fb9457ebab2ae67ab35f5f3859f96c2d6d21347c298ec356ab6e0fca8738\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe initial key I PR'd was k8, but some firmwares use k0. Since only k0 and k8 have been observed I don't think it's necessary to embed *all* of them in the source, but I'll leave them here for posterity.\r\n\r\nFor some cameras sony says \"you must update to fw x before you can update to fw y\" - this is because \"fw x\" changes the key index.\r\n\r\nEdit: more keys from fw 6.02:\r\n\r\n```\r\nk14  4590ceea9817fa655058adc4fc174099b4f0fe338096210551cb8f4387498a95\r\nk15  afaed2d1eb17b894fad2161a2482db4ffd77a20017f546f651e22fb544c2d28f\r\nk16  c58130373f0393c8b1bfe5df2ec93c23cf3a405ad41313f96364ef1172eb7838\r\nk17  4b7ca278e8ef6ec7e4adaa89083a2a66f23b4f55f91674a2f7f880a9437df6ce\r\nk18  b830f5885cc73b3e115392416b81340719279d0a80c08a0db35875e65e3d79eb\r\n```\r\n\r\n(there is no k13 apparently?)",
