    "updated_at": "2026-09-13T07:09:29Z",
    "body": "> ~So far I've only tested this with the v6.02 update for the A7 IV. Perhaps other CXD90057 devices will work?~\r\n> \r\n> So far only the Sony A7 IV is added to `devices.yml`, I'll try to round up the rest of the CXD90057 devices also.\r\n\r\nGreat work on this. One thing that matters a lot for planning around it: is the root-shell primitive at the bootROM/recovery mode level (independent of installed firmware, \u00e0 la Fus\u00e9e Gel\u00e9e), or a bug in a userspace service/OS component that's specific to whatever's running? I'm on v6.0x rather than v2.00 for the a7IV and trying to figure out if that's a blocker. ",
