    "created_at": "2026-10-04T18:09:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-04T18:09:15Z",
    "body": "Hi David,\r\n\r\nI've published a static audit of the Sony A7S III (ILCE-7SM3) firmware 5.01 BODYDATA.DAT: https://github.com/oxunjonuz/aiodam-sony-a7siii-firmware-audit. The decryption key from your PR #52 (ma1co/fwtool.py) was used, and credit is given prominently in the repo and paper.\r\n\r\nThe audit covers the full file structure, a shipped unencrypted SSH host key, and the trust boundary (signature verification is outside the file). It's static-only, with negative controls and instrument-error logs.\r\n\r\nIf you have any comments or corrections, I'd be glad to hear them. No request for anything \u2014 just letting you know the work exists and properly credits you.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
