    "updated_at": "2026-10-05T15:58:21Z",
    "body": "@oxunjonuz the private key is likely part of the camera's WBI2 partition. Which is interesting, since that's effectively a memory snapshot of the camera Sony used to prepare the image. It might be worth writing some tools to properly extract WBI2 into a flat memory image, then run it through existing memory forensics tools.\r\n\r\nIn future I would recommend recommend using fewer words to present findings, if you want people to notice the interesting parts.",
